acy and exclusivity. The setting feels tranquil yet luxurious, evoking imagery of a well-to-do suburban neighborhood or estate."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 157, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}], "flags": {}, "id": 98, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [734.6851196289062, 878.6325073242188], "pos": [1710.7672119140625, -66.43526458740234], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 41, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "flags": {}, "id": 26, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "describe", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [231.3369598388672, 727.2301025390625], "widgets_values": ["This image is a digital drawing of a modern, two-story house with a contemporary design. The house is predominantly white with a brown-tiled roof and has large glass windows that allow natural light to flood the interior. The first floor features a large glass door at the center, flanked by smaller windows on either side. The second floor has two balconies, one on the front and one on the back, each with a simple railing. The balconies have a  glass railing, adding a pop of color.\n﻿\nIn front of the house, there is a rectangular swimming pool with a fountain, situated on a smooth, light gray concrete patio. A palm tree is visible in the background, adding a touch of greenery to the otherwise minimalist scene.\n﻿\nThe house is surrounded by a black wrought-iron fence with decorative elements, and the base of the house is supported by beige stone pillars. The overall style of the house is sleek and minimalist, with clean lines and modern architectural elements. The background is a plain, light gray, which helps to emphasize the